com/users/atscott/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/atscott/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"we have a css class used to show/hide element. and we also have angular directive to take input and add/remove this class using host binding. below is the code.\r\n\r\n<pre>\r\n@Directive({\r\n  selector: '[ngShow]',\r\n  host: {\r\n    '[class.hidden]': '!ngShow',\r\n    '[attr.aria-hidden]': '!ngShow'\r\n  }\r\n})\r\nexport class NgShowDirective {\r\n  @Input()\r\n  ngShow = false;\r\n}\r\n</pre>\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n```html\r\n<div class=\"hidden\" [ngShow]=\"asyncProperty\">test 123</div>\r\n```\r\n\r\nwhen we set asyncProperty value to true after execution of an async function, it does not remove the \"hidden\" css class. this worked in angular v8 and started to break after v9 upgrade.\r\n\r\ntested against v9.1.0","closed_by":{"login":"zarend","id":7720245,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3MjAyNDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7720245?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend","html_url":"https://github.com/zarend","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zarend/repos","events_url":"https://api.git